cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VATRA or its harmonized data, please cite it as below."
title: "VATRA: Albania's Fire Calendar"
abstract: >-
  A web app and dataset that harmonize NASA FIRMS MODIS (Collection 6.1) and VIIRS 375 m (S-NPP, NOAA-20, NOAA-21)
  active fire hotspots for Albania, 2000-2026, into one MODIS-equivalent record of fire cell-days, shown as a
  burning activity calendar with normals, anomalies, trends, a fire events catalogue and validation against EFFIS.
  Built for the NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026 (Harmonization of MODIS and VIIRS Hot Spots).
type: software
authors:
